<body><div class=WordSection1>


<p style="font-family:Arial;font-size:18pt;color:#101626;margin:0 0 8pt 0"><b>Yacht Style Arabia<br>Website Question Sheet</b></p>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;" width="33%"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8pt;color:#8A93A6"><b>PREPARED BY</b></span><br>BrandMethod Sdn. Bhd. (1553794-X)</td><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;" width="33%"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8pt;color:#8A93A6"><b>PREPARED FOR</b></span><br>Heart Media Group &middot; Yacht Style Arabia &middot; Olivier Burlot, CEO</td><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;" width="33%"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8pt;color:#8A93A6"><b>CONTACT</b></span><br>bazil@brandmethod.co</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;" width="33%"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8pt;color:#8A93A6"><b>TIME NEEDED</b></span><br>Section 1 is about 5 minutes, Section 2 about 15 more</td><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;" width="33%"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8pt;color:#8A93A6"><b>HOW TO RETURN IT</b></span><br>Type into this document and email it back</td><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;" width="33%"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8pt;color:#8A93A6"><b>IF YOU ARE UNSURE</b></span><br>Leave it blank and we cover it together</td></tr></table>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="4" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:9.5pt">
<tr><td width="170" style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;background:#FAFAFC"><span style="background-color:#D9EBD9;color:#38761D;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>&nbsp;WHAT WE FOUND&nbsp;</b></span></td><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;color:#3C4043">Our research, already filled in. Correct it if we read it wrong.</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#FAFAFC" style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;background:#FAFAFC"><span style="background-color:#F8DAD7;color:#C0271D;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>&nbsp;WHAT WE NEED&nbsp;</b></span></td><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;color:#3C4043">Your part. Short answers are fine. &ldquo;Not sure yet&rdquo; is fine too.</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#FAFAFC" style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;background:#FAFAFC"><b>Tick here</b></td><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;color:#3C4043">Choice questions have a tick column: click the cell on this page, or type an X in it. The white box under a question is where you type.</td></tr>
</table>
<p style="font-size:9.5pt;color:#3C4043;margin:6pt 0 0 0">Two sections, and every question is one we need answered to build the site. <b>Section 1</b> is the title and the people: what the website says about Yacht Style Arabia, and who signs and approves. <b>Section 2</b> is the website itself. Your email of 5 October 2026 already answered part of it, so those answers are filled in, in green: correct them rather than write them again.</p>
<p style="font-size:5pt">&nbsp;</p>

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#1421B8" style="background-color:#1421B8;border:1pt solid #0F1A8A;padding:9pt 12pt"><span style="color:#9FB4FF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.09em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>SECTION 1</b></span><br><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.01em;font-size:15.5pt"><b>The title and the people</b></span><br><i><span style="color:#C9D2FA;font-size:9.5pt">What the website says about Yacht Style Arabia, and who signs and approves. About five minutes.</span></i></td></tr></table>
<p style="font-size:4pt">&nbsp;</p>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#111A33;border:1pt solid #111A33;padding:7pt 11pt"><span style="color:#9FB4FF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:9pt"><b>&#128100; YOUR DETAILS &middot; 2 MINUTES</b></span><br><i><span style="color:#D6DEF0;font-size:10pt">Green text is what we already have. Correct anything we got wrong and fill the empty rows. The company, its registration number and the billing address go on the quotation and the invoices: yachtstyle.co names Lux Inc Media as its publisher, and our proposal is addressed to Heart Media Group, so tell us which company signs.</span></i></td></tr><tr><td width="235" style="background-color:#FAFAFC;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#3C4043"><b>Company that signs and pays</b></span></td><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:10.5pt">&nbsp;</span></td></tr><tr><td width="235" style="background-color:#FAFAFC;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#3C4043"><b>Company registration no.</b></span></td><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:10.5pt">&nbsp;</span></td></tr><tr><td width="235" style="background-color:#FAFAFC;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#3C4043"><b>Billing address</b></span></td><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:10.5pt">&nbsp;</span></td></tr><tr><td width="235" style="background-color:#FAFAFC;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#3C4043"><b>The title</b></span></td><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="color:#38761D;font-size:10.5pt">Yacht Style Arabia</span></td></tr><tr><td width="235" style="background-color:#FAFAFC;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#3C4043"><b>Its website</b></span></td><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="color:#38761D;font-size:10.5pt">yachtstylearabia.com, registered on 1 October 2026, nothing live yet</span></td></tr><tr><td width="235" style="background-color:#FAFAFC;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#3C4043"><b>Social accounts the site links to</b></span></td><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="color:#38761D;font-size:10.5pt">On yachtstyle.co: Instagram @yacht.style, Facebook YachtStyle.co and a YouTube channel. Tell us if Arabia will have its own</span></td></tr><tr><td width="235" style="background-color:#FAFAFC;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#3C4043"><b>Your name</b></span></td><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="color:#38761D;font-size:10.5pt">Olivier Burlot</span></td></tr><tr><td width="235" style="background-color:#FAFAFC;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#3C4043"><b>Your designation</b></span></td><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="color:#38761D;font-size:10.5pt">CEO, Heart Media Group</span></td></tr><tr><td width="235" style="background-color:#FAFAFC;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#3C4043"><b>Email</b></span></td><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="color:#38761D;font-size:10.5pt">olivier@heart-media.com</span></td></tr><tr><td width="235" style="background-color:#FAFAFC;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#3C4043"><b>Contact number</b></span></td><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="color:#38761D;font-size:10.5pt">+65 9777 8706 (WhatsApp)</span></td></tr><tr><td width="235" style="background-color:#FAFAFC;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#3C4043"><b>Others in the discussion</b></span></td><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="color:#38761D;font-size:10.5pt">Gael and Aung, copied on your email of 5 October 2026. Please add their roles</span></td></tr></table>
<p style="font-size:4pt">&nbsp;</p>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#111A33" style="background-color:#111A33;border:1pt solid #111A33;padding:7pt 11pt"><span style="color:#9FB4FF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>&#9973; PART 1 &middot; WHAT THE SITE SAYS &middot; 3 ITEMS</b></span><br><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.02em;font-size:13pt"><b>The words the site is built around</b></span><br><i><span style="color:#D6DEF0;font-size:9.5pt">Your answers here become the first lines a reader sees.</span></i></td></tr></table>
<p style="font-size:4pt">&nbsp;</p>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#111A33" style="background-color:#111A33;border:1pt solid #111A33;padding:6pt 10pt"><span style="color:#9FB4FF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:9pt"><b>1.1</b></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11pt"><b>Describe Yacht Style Arabia in one sentence.</b></span><br><i><span style="color:#C3CEE6;font-size:9pt">It becomes the line under the masthead, the opening of the About page, and the description that search engines and AI tools show.</span></i></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#F5FAF5" style="background-color:#F5FAF5;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:5pt 10pt"><span style="background-color:#D9EBD9;color:#38761D;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>&nbsp;WHAT WE FOUND&nbsp;</b></span>&nbsp;<span style="color:#38761D;font-size:10.5pt">yachtstyle.co describes itself as &ldquo;Asia&rsquo;s leading yachting lifestyle media&rdquo;.</span></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#FFF8F7" style="background-color:#FFF8F7;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:5pt 10pt"><span style="background-color:#F8DAD7;color:#C0271D;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>&nbsp;WHAT WE NEED&nbsp;</b></span>&nbsp;<span style="color:#C0271D;font-size:9.5pt"><b>one sentence in English, and in Arabic if you have it</b></span></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#F1F3F4" style="background-color:#F1F3F4;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 10pt"><span style="color:#5F6368;font-size:9.5pt">&#128161; <b>Sample:</b> <i>The Gulf&rsquo;s yachting title, in English and Arabic: the yachts, the owners and the waters from Dubai to the Red Sea.</i></span></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#E8EEFC" style="background-color:#E8EEFC;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:3pt 10pt"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>YOUR ANSWER</b></span></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:9pt 10pt"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:10.5pt">&nbsp;</span></td></tr></table>
<p style="font-size:5pt">&nbsp;</p>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#111A33" style="background-color:#111A33;border:1pt solid #111A33;padding:6pt 10pt"><span style="color:#9FB4FF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:9pt"><b>1.2</b></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11pt"><b>Why does a reader, or an advertiser, choose Yacht Style over the other yacht titles?</b></span><br><i><span style="color:#C3CEE6;font-size:9pt">The home page, the About page and the Advertise page each say it in one line, and the brand strategy starts from it.</span></i></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#F5FAF5" style="background-color:#F5FAF5;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:5pt 10pt"><span style="background-color:#D9EBD9;color:#38761D;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>&nbsp;WHAT WE FOUND&nbsp;</b></span>&nbsp;<span style="color:#38761D;font-size:10.5pt">You named Boat International, Ocean, SuperYacht Times and Robb Report as references. None of the four is published in Arabic.</span></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#FFF8F7" style="background-color:#FFF8F7;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:5pt 10pt"><span style="background-color:#F8DAD7;color:#C0271D;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>&nbsp;WHAT WE NEED&nbsp;</b></span>&nbsp;<span style="color:#C0271D;font-size:9.5pt"><b>the one or two reasons, in your words</b></span></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#F1F3F4" style="background-color:#F1F3F4;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 10pt"><span style="color:#5F6368;font-size:9.5pt">&#128161; <b>Sample:</b> <i>We know the owners personally, we are the yacht title in Arabic, and our awards night brings the trade together.</i></span></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#E8EEFC" style="background-color:#E8EEFC;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:3pt 10pt"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>YOUR ANSWER</b></span></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:16pt 10pt"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:10.5pt">&nbsp;</span></td></tr></table>
<p style="font-size:5pt">&nbsp;</p>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#111A33" style="background-color:#111A33;border:1pt solid #111A33;padding:6pt 10pt"><span style="color:#9FB4FF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:9pt"><b>1.3</b></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11pt"><b>Where do your readers come from today, and how many are there?</b></span><br><i><span style="color:#C3CEE6;font-size:9pt">Each channel is linked to the site at launch, and the Advertise page shows only the figures you approve.</span></i></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#F5FAF5" style="background-color:#F5FAF5;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:5pt 10pt"><span style="background-color:#D9EBD9;color:#38761D;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>&nbsp;WHAT WE FOUND&nbsp;</b></span>&nbsp;<span style="color:#38761D;font-size:10.5pt">heart-media.com states 32,000 copies circulated. We have not checked that figure, and we publish no number you have not approved.</span></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#FFF8F7" style="background-color:#FFF8F7;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:5pt 10pt"><span style="background-color:#F8DAD7;color:#C0271D;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>&nbsp;WHAT WE NEED&nbsp;</b></span>&nbsp;<span style="color:#C0271D;font-size:9.5pt"><b>rough numbers are fine, and tell us which we may publish:</b></span><br><span style="color:#101626;font-size:10.5pt">&bull; print copies per issue, and where they go<br>&bull; newsletter subscribers<br>&bull; social followers, by account<br>&bull; monthly readers of yachtstyle.co<br>&bull; guests at the Yacht Style Awards</span></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#E8EEFC" style="background-color:#E8EEFC;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:3pt 10pt"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>YOUR ANSWER</b></span></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:16pt 10pt"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:10.5pt">&nbsp;</span></td></tr></table>
<p style="font-size:5pt">&nbsp;</p>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#111A33" style="background-color:#111A33;border:1pt solid #111A33;padding:7pt 11pt"><span style="color:#9FB4FF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>&#128205; PART 2 &middot; SUCCESS AND SIGN OFF &middot; 2 ITEMS</b></span><br><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.02em;font-size:13pt"><b>What the site must achieve, and who says yes</b></span><br><i><span style="color:#D6DEF0;font-size:9.5pt">Short answers.</span></i></td></tr></table>
<p style="font-size:4pt">&nbsp;</p>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#111A33" style="background-color:#111A33;border:1pt solid #111A33;padding:6pt 10pt"><span style="color:#9FB4FF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:9pt"><b>2.1</b></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11pt"><b>In 12 months, what has to be true for you to call the site a success?</b></span><br><i><span style="color:#C3CEE6;font-size:9pt">We set up the analytics to measure exactly that from the first day.</span></i></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#FFF8F7" style="background-color:#FFF8F7;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:5pt 10pt"><span style="background-color:#F8DAD7;color:#C0271D;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>&nbsp;WHAT WE NEED&nbsp;</b></span>&nbsp;<span style="color:#C0271D;font-size:9.5pt"><b>tick up to three, and add a number if you have one</b></span></td></tr>
</table>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#111A33" style="background-color:#111A33;border:1pt solid #111A33;padding:5pt 9pt"><span style="color:#9FB4FF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>TICK UP TO THREE</b></span></td><td width="118" align="center" style="background-color:#111A33;border:1pt solid #111A33;padding:5pt 8pt"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>TICK HERE</b></span></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;color:#101626">Monthly readers in the Gulf</span></td><td width="118" align="center" class="mk" style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 8pt;background-color:#FFFFFF"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:13pt"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;color:#101626">Newsletter subscribers</span></td><td width="118" align="center" class="mk" style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 8pt;background-color:#FFFFFF"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:13pt"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;color:#101626">Advertiser enquiries from the site</span></td><td width="118" align="center" class="mk" style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 8pt;background-color:#FFFFFF"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:13pt"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;color:#101626">Ranking on Google for yacht searches in the Gulf</span></td><td width="118" align="center" class="mk" style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 8pt;background-color:#FFFFFF"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:13pt"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;color:#101626">Being quoted by AI answer engines</span></td><td width="118" align="center" class="mk" style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 8pt;background-color:#FFFFFF"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:13pt"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;color:#101626">Readers of the Arabic edition</span></td><td width="118" align="center" class="mk" style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 8pt;background-color:#FFFFFF"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:13pt"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;color:#101626">Magazine subscriptions sold through the site</span></td><td width="118" align="center" class="mk" style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 8pt;background-color:#FFFFFF"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:13pt"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></td></tr></table>
<p style="font-size:4pt">&nbsp;</p>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse">
<tr><td bgcolor="#E8EEFC" style="background-color:#E8EEFC;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:3pt 10pt"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>THE NUMBER YOU WOULD CALL A SUCCESS</b></span></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:9pt 10pt"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:10.5pt">&nbsp;</span></td></tr></table>
<p style="font-size:5pt">&nbsp;</p>
