<tr><td bgcolor="#F5FAF5" style="background-color:#F5FAF5;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:5pt 10pt"><span style="background-color:#D9EBD9;color:#38761D;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>&nbsp;WHAT WE FOUND&nbsp;</b></span>&nbsp;<span style="color:#38761D;font-size:10.5pt">The Logbook on yachtstyle.co lists the Qatar Boat Show on 4 to 7 November 2026, the Abu Dhabi International Boat Show on 19 to 22 November 2026 and the Dubai International Boat Show on 25 to 29 November 2026. In our proposal Choice A is complete in two weeks with one more week of testing and amendments, and Choice B is complete in three weeks with a fourth week of amendments and fixes.</span></td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#FFF8F7" style="background-color:#FFF8F7;border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:5pt 10pt"><span style="background-color:#F8DAD7;color:#C0271D;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;font-size:8.5pt"><b>&nbsp;WHAT WE NEED&nbsp;</b></span>&nbsp;<span style="color:#C0271D;font-size:9.5pt"><b>the date, and what it is tied to</b></span></td></tr>
