 width="118" align="center" class="mk" style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 8pt;background-color:#FFFFFF"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:13pt"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;color:#101626">Section sponsorship</span></td><td width="118" align="center" class="mk" style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 8pt;background-color:#FFFFFF"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:13pt"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;color:#101626">Newsletter placements</span></td><td width="118" align="center" class="mk" style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 8pt;background-color:#FFFFFF"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:13pt"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;color:#101626">Video pre-roll</span></td><td width="118" align="center" class="mk" style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 8pt;background-color:#FFFFFF"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:13pt"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 9pt"><span style="font-size:10.5pt;color:#101626">Not decided, advise us</span></td><td width="118" align="center" class="mk" style="border:1pt solid #E3E7EE;padding:4pt 8pt;background-color:#FFFFFF"><span style="color:#1155CC;font-size:13pt"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></td></tr></table>
